# from:length: counts characters and survives very large numbers
>> s := ['ééééééééééééééé'].
Mpụta dee: (s detuo site-na: 0 ogologo: 20), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (s detuo site-na: 10 ogologo: 20), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (s detuo site-na: 14 ogologo: 1), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (s detuo mafee: 20), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: ['-'], ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (['abcdef'] site-na: 2 ogologo: 2), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (['abc'] site-na: 1 ogologo: ['9e300'] nọmba), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (['abc'] site-na: 1 ogologo: ['-9e300'] nọmba), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (['abc'] site-na: ['9e300'] nọmba ogologo: 1), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: ['-'], ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (['abc'] site-na: ['-9e300'] nọmba ogologo: 2), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (['abc'] site-na: ['nan'] nọmba ogologo: 2), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (['abc'] site-na: 0 ogologo: ['nan'] nọmba), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: ['-'], ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
